<title>USA: Dlr retreats from highs in US,mark/sfr rally cited.</title>
<headline>Dlr retreats from highs in US,mark/sfr rally cited.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Mark bites back, profits taken, mark/crosses roar. Mark/sfr leads way amid U.S. fund buying, talk of SNB liquidity add.</p>
<p>*Mark/lira also up, dealers suspect BOI purchases. Mark/yen, stg/mark show mark rebound. *Dlr/mark slides below 1.83, where Euro central banks reportedly stacked offers earlier in week.</p>
<p>*Dlr/sfr below 43-mo high 1.5033. Dlr/mark off 6-yr high 1.84.</p>
</text>
